Minimalist HUD compass for Gothic 1, Gothic 2, and mods (The Chronicles of Myrtana: Archolos, etc.).

Adds a clean, subtle hand-drawn compass rose to the top-right corner of the HUD, styled to match the authentic in-game Gothic map legend.

[b]Features:[/b]
- Minimalist hand-drawn compass rose with true North orientation tracking.
- Seamless resolution adaptation across 1080p, 1440p, 4K, and Ultrawide displays.
- Automatically hides during dialogues, inventory browsing, and cutscenes.
- Standalone Union script. Runs natively without Ninja framework.

[b]Configuration:[/b]
Edit [b]zCompass.d[/b] to customize size, opacity, or toggle visibility:
[code]
const int zCompass_Size           = 110; // size in screen pixels
const int zCompass_OpacityPercent = 90;  // opacity (0 = transparent, 100 = fully opaque)
const int zCompass_Show           = 1;   // 1 = on, 0 = off
[/code]

